    [6473] = {"尖牙铠甲", "拾取后绑定\n胸部 82 护甲 +2 力量 +7 精神。\n需要等级 18\n物品 等级 23 Embrace of the Viper (0/0) (2) Set: 提高 伤害 done by Nature 法术和effects by最多7. (3) Set: Reduces 你的 几率 to be dodged or parried by 1%. (4) Set: 提高 治疗效果 done by最多11和伤害 done by最多4 for all magical 法术和effects. (5) Set: +10 智力. (6) Set: 你的 attacks have a 几率 to apply Deviate Poison, which causes the target to take最多19 additional 伤害 from 法术.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Chest 82 Armor +2 Strength +7 Spirit"] = "胸部 82 护甲 +2 力量 +7 精神。", ["Requires Level 18"] = "需要等级 18", ["Item Level 23 Embrace of the Viper (0/0) (2) Set: Increases damage done by Nature spells and effects by up to 7. (3) Set: Reduces your chance to be dodged or parried by 1%. (4) Set: Increases healing done by up to 11 and damage done by up to 4 for all magical spells and effects. (5) Set: +10 Intellect. (6) Set: Your attacks have a chance to apply Deviate Poison, which causes the target to take up to 19 additional damage from spells."] = "物品 等级 23 Embrace of the Viper (0/0) (2) Set: 提高 伤害 done by Nature 法术和effects by最多7. (3) Set: Reduces 你的 几率 to be dodged or parried by 1%. (4) Set: 提高 治疗效果 done by最多11和伤害 done by最多4 for all magical 法术和effects. (5) Set: +10 智力. (6) Set: 你的 attacks have a 几率 to apply Deviate Poison, which causes the target to take最多19 additional 伤害 from 法术." }, "Armor of the Fang"},
