    [7997] = {"红色迪菲亚面罩", "拾取后绑定\n头部 74 护甲 +8 敏捷。\n需要等级 19\n装备：提高 你的 Stealth by 1. Defias Leather (1/0) Red Defias Mask (2) Set: 提高 你的 几率 to 躲闪 an attack by 1%. (3) Set: 提高 你的 护甲 contribution from items by 5%. (4) Set: +6 攻击强度. (5) Set: +10 攻击强度. (6) Set: 你的 attacks和远程攻击 have a 几率 to embed a knife into 你的 target, dealing 32 to 49 伤害, doubled if the target is stunned.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Head 74 Armor +8 Agility"] = "头部 74 护甲 +8 敏捷。", ["Requires Level 19"] = "需要等级 19", ["Equip: Increases your Stealth by 1. Defias Leather (1/0) Red Defias Mask (2) Set: Increases your chance to dodge an attack by 1%. (3) Set: Increases your armor contribution from items by 5%. (4) Set: +6 Attack Power. (5) Set: +10 Attack Power. (6) Set: Your attacks and ranged attacks have a chance to embed a knife into your target, dealing 32 to 49 damage, doubled if the target is stunned."] = "装备：提高 你的 Stealth by 1. Defias Leather (1/0) Red Defias Mask (2) Set: 提高 你的 几率 to 躲闪 an attack by 1%. (3) Set: 提高 你的 护甲 contribution from items by 5%. (4) Set: +6 攻击强度. (5) Set: +10 攻击强度. (6) Set: 你的 attacks和远程攻击 have a 几率 to embed a knife into 你的 target, dealing 32 to 49 伤害, doubled if the target is stunned." }, "Red Defias Mask"},
