    [15781] = {"图样：黑色龙鳞护腿", "需要 制皮 (300) Already known\n需要 Dragonscale Leatherworking\n使用：教你学会craft Black Dragonscale Leggings. nBlack Dragonscale Leggings。\n装备后绑定\n腿部 320 护甲 +12 耐力 +13 火焰抗性。\n需要等级 57\n物品等级 62\n装备：+54 攻击强度. Black Dragon Mail (0/4) Black Dragonscale 靴子 Black Dragonscale Breastplate Black Dragonscale Leggings Black Dragonscale Shoulders (2) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with melee和远程攻击 by 1%. (3) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to get a 爆击 with melee和远程攻击 by 2%. (4) Set: +10 火焰抗性. nRequires Rugged Leather (40), Black Dragonscale (60), Enchanted Leather (4), Cured Rugged Hide, Rune Thread (2)。", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Requires Leatherworking (300) Already known"] = "需要 制皮 (300) Already known", ["Requires Dragonscale Leatherworking Use: Teaches you how to craft Black Dragonscale Leggings. nBlack Dragonscale Leggings"] = "需要 Dragonscale Leatherworking\n使用：教你学会craft Black Dragonscale Leggings. nBlack Dragonscale Leggings。", ["Binds when equipped"] = "装备后绑定", ["Legs 320 Armor +12 Stamina +13 Fire Resistance"] = "腿部 320 护甲 +12 耐力 +13 火焰抗性。", ["Requires Level 57"] = "需要等级 57", ["Item Level 62"] = "物品等级 62", ["Equip: +54 Attack Power. Black Dragon Mail (0/4) Black Dragonscale Boots Black Dragonscale Breastplate Black Dragonscale Leggings Black Dragonscale Shoulders (2) Set: Improves your chance to hit with melee and ranged attacks by 1%. (3) Set: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with melee and ranged attacks by 2%. (4) Set: +10 Fire Resistance. nRequires Rugged Leather (40), Black Dragonscale (60), Enchanted Leather (4), Cured Rugged Hide, Rune Thread (2)"] = "装备：+54 攻击强度. Black Dragon Mail (0/4) Black Dragonscale 靴子 Black Dragonscale Breastplate Black Dragonscale Leggings Black Dragonscale Shoulders (2) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with melee和远程攻击 by 1%. (3) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to get a 爆击 with melee和远程攻击 by 2%. (4) Set: +10 火焰抗性. nRequires Rugged Leather (40), Black Dragonscale (60), Enchanted Leather (4), Cured Rugged Hide, Rune Thread (2)。" }, "Patt