    [17025] = {"图样：黑色龙鳞战靴", "拾取后绑定\n需要 制皮 (300) Already known\n需要 Dragonscale Leatherworking\n使用：教你学会craft Black Dragonscale 靴子. nBlack Dragonscale 靴子。\n装备后绑定\n脚 270 护甲 +15 耐力 +24 火焰抗性。\n需要等级 56\n物品等级 61\n装备：+28 攻击强度. Black Dragon Mail (0/4) Black Dragonscale 靴子 Black Dragonscale Breastplate Black Dragonscale Leggings Black Dragonscale Shoulders (2) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with melee和远程攻击 by 1%. (3) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to get a 爆击 with melee和远程攻击 by 2%. (4) Set: +10 火焰抗性. nRequires Enchanted Leather (6), Black Dragonscale (30), Fiery Core (4), Lava Core (3), Rune Thread (2)。", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Requires Leatherworking (300) Already known"] = "需要 制皮 (300) Already known", ["Requires Dragonscale Leatherworking Use: Teaches you how to craft Black Dragonscale Boots. nBlack Dragonscale Boots"] = "需要 Dragonscale Leatherworking\n使用：教你学会craft Black Dragonscale 靴子. nBlack Dragonscale 靴子。", ["Binds when equipped"] = "装备后绑定", ["Feet 270 Armor +15 Stamina +24 Fire Resistance"] = "脚 270 护甲 +15 耐力 +24 火焰抗性。", ["Requires Level 56"] = "需要等级 56", ["Item Level 61"] = "物品等级 61", ["Equip: +28 Attack Power. Black Dragon Mail (0/4) Black Dragonscale Boots Black Dragonscale Breastplate Black Dragonscale Leggings Black Dragonscale Shoulders (2) Set: Improves your chance to hit with melee and ranged attacks by 1%. (3) Set: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with melee and ranged attacks by 2%. (4) Set: +10 Fire Resistance. nRequires Enchanted Leather (6), Black Dragonscale (30), Fiery Core (4), Lava Core (3), Rune Thread (2)"] = "装备：+28 攻击强度. Black Dragon Mail (0/4) Black Dragonscale 靴子 Black Dragonscale Breastplate Black Dragonscale Leggings Black Dragonscale Shoulders (2) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with melee和远程攻击 by 1%. (3) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to get a 爆击 with melee和远程攻击 by 2%. (4) Set: +10 火焰抗性. nRequires Enchanted Leather (6), Black Dragonscale (30), Fiery Core (4), Lava Core (3), Rune Thread (2)。" }, "Pattern: Black Drago