    [19148] = {"黑铁头盔", "装备后绑定\n头部 758 护甲 +30 耐力 +35 火焰抗性。\n需要等级 60\n物品 等级 66 Dark Iron Plate (0/8) Dark Iron Helm Dark Iron Leggings Dark Iron 靴子 Dark Iron Gauntlets Dark Iron Bracers Dark Iron Plate Dark Iron Shoulders Dark Iron 腰带 (2) Set: +10 火焰抗性. (4) Set: +36 攻击强度 when fighting Elementals. (6) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with melee和远程攻击 by 1%. (8) Set: While you are in an area touched by the Firelord, 你的 攻击强度和法术 伤害 is increased by 75.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when equipped"] = "装备后绑定", ["Head 758 Armor +30 Stamina +35 Fire Resistance"] = "头部 758 护甲 +30 耐力 +35 火焰抗性。", ["Requires Level 60"] = "需要等级 60", ["Item Level 66 Dark Iron Plate (0/8) Dark Iron Helm Dark Iron Leggings Dark Iron Boots Dark Iron Gauntlets Dark Iron Bracers Dark Iron Plate Dark Iron Shoulders Dark Iron Belt (2) Set: +10 Fire Resistance. (4) Set: +36 Attack Power when fighting Elementals. (6) Set: Improves your chance to hit with melee and ranged attacks by 1%. (8) Set: While you are in an area touched by the Firelord, your attack power and spell damage is increased by 75."] = "物品 等级 66 Dark Iron Plate (0/8) Dark Iron Helm Dark Iron Leggings Dark Iron 靴子 Dark Iron Gauntlets Dark Iron Bracers Dark Iron Plate Dark Iron Shoulders Dark Iron 腰带 (2) Set: +10 火焰抗性. (4) Set: +36 攻击强度 when fighting Elementals. (6) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with melee和远程攻击 by 1%. (8) Set: While you are in an area touched by the Firelord, 你的 攻击强度和法术 伤害 is increased by 75." }, "Dark Iron Helm"},
