    [21350] = {"神谕者的衬肩", "拾取后绑定\n肩部 119 护甲 +31 耐力 +20 智力 +8 精神。\n职业：牧师\n需要等级 60\n物品等级 78\n装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多20. Equip: 恢复 3 法力值 per 5秒. Equip: 降低 the magical resistances of 你的 法术 targets by 10. Garments of the Oracle (0/5) Footwraps of the Oracle Mantle of the Oracle Tiara of the Oracle Trousers of the Oracle Vestments of the Oracle (3) Set: 20% 几率 that 你的 heals on others will also heal you 10% of the amount healed. (5) Set: 提高 the duration of 你的 Renew 法术 by 3秒.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Shoulder 119 Armor +31 Stamina +20 Intellect +8 Spirit"] = "肩部 119 护甲 +31 耐力 +20 智力 +8 精神。", ["Classes: Priest"] = "职业：牧师", ["Requires Level 60"] = "需要等级 60", ["Item Level 78"] = "物品等级 78", ["Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 20. Equip: Restores 3 mana per 5 sec. Equip: Decreases the magical resistances of your spell targets by 10. Garments of the Oracle (0/5) Footwraps of the Oracle Mantle of the Oracle Tiara of the Oracle Trousers of the Oracle Vestments of the Oracle (3) Set: 20% chance that your heals on others will also heal you 10% of the amount healed. (5) Set: Increases the duration of your Renew spell by 3 sec."] = "装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多20. Equip: 恢复 3 法力值 per 5秒. Equip: 降低 the magical resistances of 你的 法术 targets by 10. Garments of the Oracle (0/5) Footwraps of the Oracle Mantle of the Oracle Tiara of the Oracle Trousers of the Oracle Vestments of the Oracle (3) Set: 20% 几率 that 你的 heals on others will also heal you 10% of the amount healed. (5) Set: 提高 the duration of 你的 Renew 法术 by 3秒." }, "Mantle of the Oracle"},
