ties by 5." }, "Darkmantle Tunic"},
    [22010] = {"兽王腰带", "拾取后绑定\n腰部 208 护甲 +18 敏捷 +20 耐力 +10 智力 物品 等级 63 Beastmaster 护甲 (3/0) Beastmaster's 腰带 Beastmaster's Gloves Beastmaster's Bindings Set: +4 所有抗性. (4) Set: Reduces the 冷却 on 你的 traps by 4秒. (6) Set: Aspect of the Viper gains an additional 20% of 你的 current 等级. (8) Set: Steady Shot 提高 the 伤害 dealt by 你的 next Serpent Sting by 3%, stacking最多10 times.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Waist 208 Armor +18 Agility +20 Stamina +10 Intellect Item Level 63 Beastmaster Armor (3/0) Beastmaster's Belt Beastmaster's Gloves Beastmaster's Bindings Set: +4 All Resistances. (4) Set: Reduces the cooldown on your traps by 4 sec. (6) Set: Aspect of the Viper gains an additional 20% of your current level. (8) Set: Steady Shot increases the damage dealt by your next Serpent Sting by 3%, stacking up to 10 times."] = "腰部 208 护甲 +18 敏捷 +20 耐力 +10 智力 物品 等级 63 Beastmaster 护甲 (3/0) Beastmaster's 腰带 Beastmaster's Gloves Beastmaster's Bindings Set: +4 所有抗性. (4) Set: Reduces the 冷却 on 你的 traps by 4秒. (6) Set: Aspect of the Viper gains an additional 20% of 你的 current 等级. (8) Set: Steady Shot 提高 the 伤害 dealt by 你的 next Serpent Sting by 3%, stacking最多10 times." }, "Beastmaster's Belt"},
