    [22077] = {"死雾裹手", "拾取后绑定\n手 59 护甲 +17 耐力 +12 智力。\n装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多20. Equip: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 2%. Deathmist Raiment (0/0) (2) Set: +20 火焰抗性. (4) Set: 提高 the 伤害 done by 你的 Shadow Bolt和Drain Soul by 3%. (6) Set: 提高 the radius of Seed of Corruption's detonation by 3 yards. Casting Shadowfury now 降低 the 法力值 cost of Rain of Fire by 40%和causes it to deal 15% more 伤害 for 10秒. (8) Set: Casting Death Coil within 3秒 after casting Life Tap will cause 你的 Death Coil to deal 100% increased 伤害, but cannot critically 命中和will not horrify.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Hands 59 Armor +17 Stamina +12 Intellect"] = "手 59 护甲 +17 耐力 +12 智力。", ["Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 20. Equip: Improves your chance to hit with spells by 2%. Deathmist Raiment (0/0) (2) Set: +20 Fire Resistance. (4) Set: Increases the damage done by your Shadow Bolt and Drain Soul by 3%. (6) Set: Increases the radius of Seed of Corruption's detonation by 3 yards. Casting Shadowfury now decreases the mana cost of Rain of Fire by 40% and causes it to deal 15% more damage for 10 sec. (8) Set: Casting Death Coil within 3 seconds after casting Life Tap will cause your Death Coil to deal 100% increased damage, but cannot critically hit and will not horrify."] = "装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多20. Equip: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 2%. Deathmist Raiment (0/0) (2) Set: +20 火焰抗性. (4) Set: 提高 the 伤害 done by 你的 Shadow Bolt和Drain Soul by 3%. (6) Set: 提高 the radius of Seed of Corruption's detonation by 3 yards. Casting Shadowfury now 降低 the 法力值 cost of Rain of Fire by 40%和causes it to deal 15% more 伤害 for 10秒. (8) Set: Casting Death Coil within 3秒 after casting Life Tap will cause 你的 Death Coil to deal 100% increased 伤害, but cannot critically 命中和will not horrify." }, "Deathmist Wraps"},
    [22078] = {"坚贞腰带", "拾取后绑定\n腰部 49 护甲 +15 耐力 +10 智力 +14 精神 物品 等级 63。\n装备：提高 治疗效果 done by最多25和伤害 done by最多8 for all magical 法术和effects. Vestments of the Virtuous (0/8) Virtuous Crown Virtuous Mantle Virtuous Robe Virtuous 腰带 Virtuous Gloves Virtuous Skirt Virtuous Sandals Virtuous Bracers (2) Set: +20 暗影抗性. (4) Set: Smite now also 降低 the 伤害 of 目标的 next attack by 104. (6) Set: Heal, Lesser Heal, Greater Heal,和Flash Heal have a 2% increased 几率 to critically heal. (8) Set: Casting Power Word: Shield when you are not in combat makes the absorption 效果 40% stronger.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Waist 49 Armor +15 Stamina +10 Intellect +14 Spirit Item Level 63"] = "腰部 49 护甲 +15 耐力 +10 智力 +14 精神 物品 等级 63。", ["Equip: Increases healing done by up to 25 and damage done by up to 8 for all magical spells and effects. Vestments of the Virtuous (0/8) Virtuous Crown Virtuous Mantle Virtuous Robe Virtuous Belt Virtuous Gloves Virtuous Skirt Virtuous Sandals Virtuous Bracers (2) Set: +20 Shadow Resistance. (4) Set: Smite now also decreases the damage of the target's next attack by 104. (6) Set: Heal, Lesser Heal, Greater Heal, and Flash Heal have a 2% increased chance to critically heal. (8) Set: Casting Power Word: Shield when you are not in combat makes the absorption effect 40% stronger."] = "装备：提高 治疗效果 done by最多25和伤害 done by最多8 for all magical 法术和effects. Vestments of the Virtuous (0/8) Virtuous Crown Virtuous Mantle Virtuous Robe Virtuous 腰带 Virtuous Gloves Virtuous Skirt Virtuous Sandals Virtuous Bracers (2) Set: +20 暗影抗性. (4) Set: Smite now also 降低 the 伤害 of 目标的 next attack by 104. (6) Set: Heal, Lesser Heal, Greater Heal,和Flash Heal have a 2% increased 几率 to critically heal. (8) Set: Casting Power Word: Shield when you are not in combat makes the absorption 效果 40% stronger." }, "Virtuous Belt"},
