    [22086] = {"魂铸腰带", "拾取后绑定\n腰部 369 护甲 +14 力量 +15 耐力 物品 等级 63。\n装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多21. Soulforge 护甲 (0/0) (2) Set: +20 暗影抗性. (4) Set: 提高 the 爆击 几率 of 你的 Seal 法术 that are capable of critically striking by 2%. (6) Set: Damaging an enemy with Hammer of Wrath empowers 你的 Consecration, reducing its 法力值 cost by 80% for 8秒. (8) Set: Verdict now has a 33% 几率 to make 你的 next Hammer of Wrath usable on any target regardless of their 生命值.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Waist 369 Armor +14 Strength +15 Stamina Item Level 63"] = "腰部 369 护甲 +14 力量 +15 耐力 物品 等级 63。", ["Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 21. Soulforge Armor (0/0) (2) Set: +20 Shadow Resistance. (4) Set: Increases the critical strike chance of your Seal spells that are capable of critically striking by 2%. (6) Set: Damaging an enemy with Hammer of Wrath empowers your Consecration, reducing its mana cost by 80% for 8 sec. (8) Set: Verdict now has a 33% chance to make your next Hammer of Wrath usable on any target regardless of their health."] = "装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多21. Soulforge 护甲 (0/0) (2) Set: +20 暗影抗性. (4) Set: 提高 the 爆击 几率 of 你的 Seal 法术 that are capable of critically striking by 2%. (6) Set: Damaging an enemy with Hammer of Wrath empowers 你的 Consecration, reducing its 法力值 cost by 80% for 8秒. (8) Set: Verdict now has a 33% 几率 to make 你的 next Hammer of Wrath usable on any target regardless of their 生命值." }, "Soulforge Belt"},
