    [22106] = {"狂野之心腰带", "拾取后绑定\n腰部 99 护甲 +24 敏捷 +18 耐力 物品 等级 63 Feralheart Raiment (0/8) Feralheart Cowl Feralheart Spaulders Feralheart Vest Feralheart 腰带 Feralheart Gloves Feralheart Kilt Feralheart 靴子 Feralheart Bracers (2) Set: +20 奥术抗性. (4) Set: 你的 increased 护甲 value from Dire Bear Form is kept upon leaving the form for 5秒. This 效果 is lost early if you enter another animal form.nReduces the 能量 cost of Mangle (Cat) by 3. (6) Set: The duration of 你的 Rip is increased by 2秒和the 爆击 几率 of Shred is increased by 3%.nCooldown of Challenging Roar reduced by 20%. (8) Set: Swipe generates an additional 85 threat on each target it hits.nIncreases 你的 最大 能量 by 20 in Cat Form.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Waist 99 Armor +24 Agility +18 Stamina Item Level 63 Feralheart Raiment (0/8) Feralheart Cowl Feralheart Spaulders Feralheart Vest Feralheart Belt Feralheart Gloves Feralheart Kilt Feralheart Boots Feralheart Bracers (2) Set: +20 Arcane Resistance. (4) Set: Your increased armor value from Dire Bear Form is kept upon leaving the form for 5 sec. This effect is lost early if you enter another animal form.nReduces the energy cost of Mangle (Cat) by 3. (6) Set: The duration of your Rip is increased by 2 seconds and the critical strike chance of Shred is increased by 3%.nCooldown of Challenging Roar reduced by 20%. (8) Set: Swipe generates an additional 85 threat on each target it hits.nIncreases your maximum energy by 20 in Cat Form."] = "腰部 99 护甲 +24 敏捷 +18 耐力 物品 等级 63 Feralheart Raiment (0/8) Feralheart Cowl Feralheart Spaulders Feralheart Vest Feralheart 腰带 Feralheart Gloves Feralheart Kilt Feralheart 靴子 Feralheart Bracers (2) Set: +20 奥术抗性. (4) Set: 你的 increased 护甲 value from Dire Bear Form is kept upon leaving the form for 5秒. This 效果 is lost early if you enter another animal form.nReduces the 能量 cost of Mangle (Cat) by 3. (6) Set: The duration of 你的 Rip is increased by 2秒和the 爆击 几率 of Shred is increased by 3%.nCooldown of Challenging Roar reduced by 20%. (8) Set: Swipe generates an additional 85 threat on each target it hits.nIncreases 你的 最大 能量 by 20 in Cat Form." }, "Feralheart Belt"},
