    [31357] = {"配方：多重抗性合剂", "拾取后绑定\n需要 炼金术 (300)\n需要 Lower City - Exalted\n使用：教你学会make a Flask of Chromatic Resistance. nFlask of Chromatic Resistance。\n需要等级 50\n使用：提高 你的 resistance to 所有魔法系 by 25 for 2小时. Counts as both a Battle和守护药剂. This 效果 persists through death和stacks with all other resistance 法术和items. nRequires Icecap (30), Mountain Silversage (10), Black Lotus, Crystal Vial。", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Requires Alchemy (300)"] = "需要 炼金术 (300)", ["Requires Lower City - Exalted Use: Teaches you how to make a Flask of Chromatic Resistance. nFlask of Chromatic Resistance"] = "需要 Lower City - Exalted\n使用：教你学会make a Flask of Chromatic Resistance. nFlask of Chromatic Resistance。", ["Requires Level 50"] = "需要等级 50", ["Use: Increases your resistance to all schools of magic by 25 for 2 hrs. Counts as both a Battle and Guardian elixir. This effect persists through death and stacks with all other resistance spells and items. nRequires Icecap (30), Mountain Silversage (10), Black Lotus, Crystal Vial"] = "使用：提高 你的 resistance to 所有魔法系 by 25 for 2小时. Counts as both a Battle和守护药剂. This 效果 persists through death和stacks with all other resistance 法术和items. nRequires Icecap (30), Mountain Silversage (10), Black Lotus, Crystal Vial。" }, "Recipe: Flask of Chromatic Resistance"},
