    [60285] = {"羽心腰带", "拾取后绑定\n腰部 99 护甲 +14 耐力 +9 智力 物品 等级 63。\n装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多18. Equip: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 1%. Featherheart Raiment (6/8) Featherheart Cowl Featherheart Spaulders Featherheart Vest Featherheart 腰带 Featherheart Gloves Featherheart Kilt Featherheart 靴子 Featherheart Bracers Set: +20 奥术抗性. Set: Using Innervate on another target also grants you Innervate at 15% effectiveness. Set: Every time 你的 Hurricane 法术 deals 伤害 its 冷却 is reduced by 0.5秒. (8) Set: Each time Moonfire deals periodic 伤害, 你的 next Starfire costs 5% less 法力值和casts 0.1秒 faster, stacking最多20 times.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Waist 99 Armor +14 Stamina +9 Intellect Item Level 63"] = "腰部 99 护甲 +14 耐力 +9 智力 物品 等级 63。", ["Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18. Equip: Improves your chance to hit with spells by 1%. Featherheart Raiment (6/8) Featherheart Cowl Featherheart Spaulders Featherheart Vest Featherheart Belt Featherheart Gloves Featherheart Kilt Featherheart Boots Featherheart Bracers Set: +20 Arcane Resistance. Set: Using Innervate on another target also grants you Innervate at 15% effectiveness. Set: Every time your Hurricane spell deals damage its cooldown is reduced by 0.5 sec. (8) Set: Each time Moonfire deals periodic damage, your next Starfire costs 5% less mana and casts 0.1 seconds faster, stacking up to 20 times."] = "装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多18. Equip: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 1%. Featherheart Raiment (6/8) Featherheart Cowl Featherheart Spaulders Featherheart Vest Featherheart 腰带 Featherheart Gloves Featherheart Kilt Featherheart 靴子 Featherheart Bracers Set: +20 奥术抗性. Set: Using Innervate on another target also grants you Innervate at 15% effectiveness. Set: Every time 你的 Hurricane 法术 deals 伤害 its 冷却 is reduced by 0.5秒. (8) Set: Each time Moonfire deals periodic 伤害, 你的 next Starfire costs 5% less 法力值和casts 0.1秒 faster, stacking最多20 times." }, "Featherheart Belt"},
