    [60313] = {"圣铸腰带", "拾取后绑定\n腰部 369 护甲 +16 耐力 +15 智力 物品 等级 63。\n装备：提高 治疗效果 done by最多24和伤害 done by最多7 for all magical 法术和effects. Equip: 恢复 2 法力值 per 5秒. Holyforge 护甲 (0/8) Holyforge Helm Holyforge Spaulders Holyforge Breastplate Holyforge 腰带 Holyforge Gauntlets Holyforge Legplates Holyforge 靴子 Holyforge Bracers (2) Set: +20 暗影抗性. (4) Set: 提高 the 伤害和治疗效果 of Holy Shock by 4%. (6) Set: Reduces the 冷却 of 你的 Divine Illumination by 30秒. (8) Set: Divine Protection和Divine Shield now also bless nearby party members, reducing their 伤害 taken by 20% for as long as you are shielded from harm.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Waist 369 Armor +16 Stamina +15 Intellect Item Level 63"] = "腰部 369 护甲 +16 耐力 +15 智力 物品 等级 63。", ["Equip: Increases healing done by up to 24 and damage done by up to 7 for all magical spells and effects. Equip: Restores 2 mana per 5 sec. Holyforge Armor (0/8) Holyforge Helm Holyforge Spaulders Holyforge Breastplate Holyforge Belt Holyforge Gauntlets Holyforge Legplates Holyforge Boots Holyforge Bracers (2) Set: +20 Shadow Resistance. (4) Set: Increases the damage and healing of Holy Shock by 4%. (6) Set: Reduces the cooldown of your Divine Illumination by 30 seconds. (8) Set: Divine Protection and Divine Shield now also bless nearby party members, reducing their damage taken by 20% for as long as you are shielded from harm."] = "装备：提高 治疗效果 done by最多24和伤害 done by最多7 for all magical 法术和effects. Equip: 恢复 2 法力值 per 5秒. Holyforge 护甲 (0/8) Holyforge Helm Holyforge Spaulders Holyforge Breastplate Holyforge 腰带 Holyforge Gauntlets Holyforge Legplates Holyforge 靴子 Holyforge Bracers (2) Set: +20 暗影抗性. (4) Set: 提高 the 伤害和治疗效果 of Holy Shock by 4%. (6) Set: Reduces the 冷却 of 你的 Divine Illumination by 30秒. (8) Set: Divine Protection和Divine Shield now also bless nearby party members, reducing their 伤害 taken by 20% for as long as you are shielded from harm." }, "Holyforge Belt"},
