    [60321] = {"虔诚腰带", "拾取后绑定\n腰部 49 护甲 +15 耐力 +14 智力 +12 精神 物品 等级 63。\n装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多14. Vestments of the Pious (5/8) Pious Crown Pious Mantle Pious Robe Pious 腰带 Pious Gloves Pious Skirt Pious Sandals Pious Bracers Set: +20 暗影抗性. Set: 提高 the 伤害 dealt by 你的 Priest periodic effects by 2%. (6) Set: Killing a target with Shadow Word: Death now also 降低 the 冷却 of Shadowfiend by 30秒. (8) Set: Causing 伤害 to an enemy with or taking 伤害 from Shadow Word: Death now gives 你的 Mind Blast a 12% increased 几率 to critically strike. Lasts 8秒. Stacks最多2 times.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Waist 49 Armor +15 Stamina +14 Intellect +12 Spirit Item Level 63"] = "腰部 49 护甲 +15 耐力 +14 智力 +12 精神 物品 等级 63。", ["Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 14. Vestments of the Pious (5/8) Pious Crown Pious Mantle Pious Robe Pious Belt Pious Gloves Pious Skirt Pious Sandals Pious Bracers Set: +20 Shadow Resistance. Set: Increases the damage dealt by your Priest periodic effects by 2%. (6) Set: Killing a target with Shadow Word: Death now also decreases the cooldown of Shadowfiend by 30 seconds. (8) Set: Causing damage to an enemy with or taking damage from Shadow Word: Death now gives your Mind Blast a 12% increased chance to critically strike. Lasts 8 sec. Stacks up to 2 times."] = "装备：提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多14. Vestments of the Pious (5/8) Pious Crown Pious Mantle Pious Robe Pious 腰带 Pious Gloves Pious Skirt Pious Sandals Pious Bracers Set: +20 暗影抗性. Set: 提高 the 伤害 dealt by 你的 Priest periodic effects by 2%. (6) Set: Killing a target with Shadow Word: Death now also 降低 the 冷却 of Shadowfiend by 30秒. (8) Set: Causing 伤害 to an enemy with or taking 伤害 from Shadow Word: Death now gives 你的 Mind Blast a 12% increased 几率 to critically strike. Lasts 8秒. Stacks最多2 times." }, "Pious Belt"},
