    [60588] = {"符文看守者披肩", "拾取后绑定\n唯一\n肩部 65 护甲 +21 耐力。\n需要等级 57\n物品等级 62\n装备：Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 1%. Equip: Improves 你的 几率 to get a 爆击 with 法术 by 1%. Rune Warder (0/6) Rune Warder's Cowl Rune Warder's Mantle Rune Warder's Raiment Rune Warder's Loins Rune Warder's 靴子 Rune Warder's 手 (2) Set: +15 Arcane和暗影抗性 (3) Set: 提高 你的 护甲 value from items by 10%. (4) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 2%. (5) Set: 提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多23. (6) Set: 你的 damaging 法术 have a 几率 to draw a rune at 你的 location for 14秒, standing in this rune 提高 the effectiveness of 你的 other Rune Warder set effects by 100%.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Unique"] = "唯一", ["Shoulder 65 Armor +21 Stamina"] = "肩部 65 护甲 +21 耐力。", ["Requires Level 57"] = "需要等级 57", ["Item Level 62"] = "物品等级 62", ["Equip: Improves your chance to hit with spells by 1%. Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with spells by 1%. Rune Warder (0/6) Rune Warder's Cowl Rune Warder's Mantle Rune Warder's Raiment Rune Warder's Loins Rune Warder's Boots Rune Warder's Hands (2) Set: +15 Arcane and Shadow Resistance (3) Set: Increases your armor value from items by 10%. (4) Set: Improves your chance to hit with spells by 2%. (5) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 23. (6) Set: Your damaging spells have a chance to draw a rune at your location for 14 sec, standing in this rune increases the effectiveness of your other Rune Warder set effects by 100%."] = "装备：Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 1%. Equip: Improves 你的 几率 to get a 爆击 with 法术 by 1%. Rune Warder (0/6) Rune Warder's Cowl Rune Warder's Mantle Rune Warder's Raiment Rune Warder's Loins Rune Warder's 靴子 Rune Warder's 手 (2) Set: +15 Arcane和暗影抗性 (3) Set: 提高 你的 护甲 value from items by 10%. (4) Set: Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with 法术 by 2%. (5) Set: 提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多23. (6) Set: 你的 damaging 法术 have a 几率 to draw a rune at 你的 location for 14秒, standing in this rune 提高 the effectiveness of 你的 other Rune Warder set effects by 100%." }, "Rune Warder's Mantle"},
