    [60763] = {"痛苦雕文", "使用：将你身上的灾火诅咒转移给一个敌方目标。只能在诅咒之地使用。（10秒冷却）\nThe rune makes you feel uneasy...", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Use: Transfers the Balefire curse from you to an enemy target. Only usable in the Blasted Lands. (10 Sec Cooldown)"] = "使用：将你身上的灾火诅咒转移给一个敌方目标。只能在诅咒之地使用。（10秒冷却）", ["\"The rune makes you feel uneasy...\""] = "The rune makes you feel uneasy..." }, "Glyph of Affliction"},
