    [61021] = {"散兵的部落徽记", "拾取后绑定\n唯一\n-装备后 饰品。\n种族：兽人、亡灵、牛头人、巨魔\n需要等级 25\n物品等级 30\n使用：Removes all movement impairing effects和all effects which cause loss of control of 你的 character. (2分钟 冷却) Skirmisher Fighter (1/2) Skirmisher's Insignia of the Horde Emblem (2) Set: 提高 你的 主属性 by 4和耐力 by an additional 14 when in Arenas, Battlegrounds,和PvP Objectives.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Unique"] = "唯一", ["-Equipped Trinket"] = "-装备后 饰品。", ["Races: Orc, Undead, Tauren, Troll"] = "种族：兽人、亡灵、牛头人、巨魔", ["Requires Level 25"] = "需要等级 25", ["Item Level 30"] = "物品等级 30", ["Use: Removes all movement impairing effects and all effects which cause loss of control of your character. (2 Min Cooldown) Skirmisher Fighter (1/2) Skirmisher's Insignia of the Horde Emblem (2) Set: Increases your Primary Stats by 4 and Stamina by an additional 14 when in Arenas, Battlegrounds, and PvP Objectives."] = "使用：Removes all movement impairing effects和all effects which cause loss of control of 你的 character. (2分钟 冷却) Skirmisher Fighter (1/2) Skirmisher's Insignia of the Horde Emblem (2) Set: 提高 你的 主属性 by 4和耐力 by an additional 14 when in Arenas, Battlegrounds,和PvP Objectives." }, "Skirmisher's Insignia of the Horde"},
