    [61053] = {"战斗者的兜帽", "拾取后绑定\n头部 55 护甲 +10 耐力 +8 智力。\n职业：牧师、法师、术士\n需要等级 35\n物品等级 40\n装备：降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. Combatant Spellcaster's Regalia (0/8) Combatant's Hood Combatant's Mantle Combatant's Robe Combatant's Handcloth Combatant's Leggings Combatant's Slippers Combatant's Wristwraps Combatant's Waistband (2) Set: 降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. (4) Set: 提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多19. (6) Set: 恢复 87 生命值 when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This 效果 cannot occur more than once every 10秒.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Head 55 Armor +10 Stamina +8 Intellect"] = "头部 55 护甲 +10 耐力 +8 智力。", ["Classes: Priest, Mage, Warlock"] = "职业：牧师、法师、术士", ["Requires Level 35"] = "需要等级 35", ["Item Level 40"] = "物品等级 40", ["Equip: Decreases your damage taken from other players by 2%. Combatant Spellcaster's Regalia (0/8) Combatant's Hood Combatant's Mantle Combatant's Robe Combatant's Handcloth Combatant's Leggings Combatant's Slippers Combatant's Wristwraps Combatant's Waistband (2) Set: Decreases your damage taken from other players by 2%. (4) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 19. (6) Set: Restores 87 health when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This effect cannot occur more than once every 10 seconds."] = "装备：降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. Combatant Spellcaster's Regalia (0/8) Combatant's Hood Combatant's Mantle Combatant's Robe Combatant's Handcloth Combatant's Leggings Combatant's Slippers Combatant's Wristwraps Combatant's Waistband (2) Set: 降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. (4) Set: 提高 伤害和治疗效果 done by magical 法术和effects by最多19. (6) Set: 恢复 87 生命值 when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This 效果 cannot occur more than once every 10秒." }, "Combatant's Hood"},
