    [61274] = {"候选者的圆顶", "拾取后绑定\n头部 391 护甲 +15 耐力 +10 智力。\n职业：战士、圣骑士\n需要等级 45\n装备：降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. Aspirant Healer's Regalia (0/8) Aspirant's Dome Aspirant's Platepads Aspirant's Breastplate Aspirant's Plated Fists Aspirant's Plate 裤子 Aspirant's Sabatons Aspirant's Wristguards Aspirant's Girdle (2) Set: 降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. (4) Set: 提高 治疗效果 done by最多48和伤害 done by最多16 for all magical 法术和effects. (6) Set: 恢复 257 法力值 when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This 效果 cannot occur more than once every 10秒.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Head 391 Armor +15 Stamina +10 Intellect"] = "头部 391 护甲 +15 耐力 +10 智力。", ["Classes: Warrior, Paladin"] = "职业：战士、圣骑士", ["Requires Level 45"] = "需要等级 45", ["Equip: Decreases your damage taken from other players by 2%. Aspirant Healer's Regalia (0/8) Aspirant's Dome Aspirant's Platepads Aspirant's Breastplate Aspirant's Plated Fists Aspirant's Plate Pants Aspirant's Sabatons Aspirant's Wristguards Aspirant's Girdle (2) Set: Decreases your damage taken from other players by 2%. (4) Set: Increases healing done by up to 48 and damage done by up to 16 for all magical spells and effects. (6) Set: Restores 257 mana when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This effect cannot occur more than once every 10 seconds."] = "装备：降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. Aspirant Healer's Regalia (0/8) Aspirant's Dome Aspirant's Platepads Aspirant's Breastplate Aspirant's Plated Fists Aspirant's Plate 裤子 Aspirant's Sabatons Aspirant's Wristguards Aspirant's Girdle (2) Set: 降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 2%. (4) Set: 提高 治疗效果 done by最多48和伤害 done by最多16 for all magical 法术和effects. (6) Set: 恢复 257 法力值 when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This 效果 cannot occur more than once every 10秒." }, "Aspirant's Dome"},
