    [90525] = {"设计图：木炭夹钳", "需要 制皮 (270)\n使用：教你学会make Charcoal Grippers. nCharcoal Grippers。\n装备后绑定\n手 100 护甲 +15 耐力 +10 火焰抗性。\n需要等级 58\n物品等级 63\n装备：Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with all 法术和attacks by 1%. Use: Absorbs 600 to 800 Fire 伤害. Lasts 30秒. (10分钟 冷却) nRequires Rugged Leather (30), Enchanted Leather (4), Elemental Fire (8), Chimera Leather (4), Rune Thread (2)。", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Requires Leatherworking (270)"] = "需要 制皮 (270)", ["Use: Teaches you how to make Charcoal Grippers. nCharcoal Grippers"] = "使用：教你学会make Charcoal Grippers. nCharcoal Grippers。", ["Binds when equipped"] = "装备后绑定", ["Hands 100 Armor +15 Stamina +10 Fire Resistance"] = "手 100 护甲 +15 耐力 +10 火焰抗性。", ["Requires Level 58"] = "需要等级 58", ["Item Level 63"] = "物品等级 63", ["Equip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%. Use: Absorbs 600 to 800 Fire damage. Lasts 30 sec. (10 Min Cooldown) nRequires Rugged Leather (30), Enchanted Leather (4), Elemental Fire (8), Chimera Leather (4), Rune Thread (2)"] = "装备：Improves 你的 几率 to 命中 with all 法术和attacks by 1%. Use: Absorbs 600 to 800 Fire 伤害. Lasts 30秒. (10分钟 冷却) nRequires Rugged Leather (30), Enchanted Leather (4), Elemental Fire (8), Chimera Leather (4), Rune Thread (2)。" }, "Plans: Charcoal Grippers"},
