    [90607] = {"对手的适应徽章", "拾取后绑定\n唯一\n-装备后: PvP Insignia (1) 饰品。\n需要等级 60\n物品等级 63\n装备：Removes any loss of control 效果 with a duration of 5秒 or more. This 效果 can only occur once every 1分钟. Equip: 降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 1%. Veteran (0/2) Rival's Insignia of the Alliance Rival's Insignia of the Horde (2) Set: 提高 你的 主属性 by 15和耐力 by an additional 50 when in Arenas, Battlegrounds,和PvP Objectives.", "EpochHead 消耗品", "consumable", { ["Binds when picked up"] = "拾取后绑定", ["Unique"] = "唯一", ["-Equipped: PvP Insignia (1) Trinket"] = "-装备后: PvP Insignia (1) 饰品。", ["Requires Level 60"] = "需要等级 60", ["Item Level 63"] = "物品等级 63", ["Equip: Removes any loss of control effect with a duration of 5 seconds or more. This effect can only occur once every 1 min. Equip: Decreases your damage taken from other players by 1%. Veteran (0/2) Rival's Insignia of the Alliance Rival's Insignia of the Horde (2) Set: Increases your Primary Stats by 15 and Stamina by an additional 50 when in Arenas, Battlegrounds, and PvP Objectives."] = "装备：Removes any loss of control 效果 with a duration of 5秒 or more. This 效果 can only occur once every 1分钟. Equip: 降低 你的 伤害 taken from other players by 1%. Veteran (0/2) Rival's Insignia of the Alliance Rival's Insignia of the Horde (2) Set: 提高 你的 主属性 by 15和耐力 by an additional 50 when in Arenas, Battlegrounds,和PvP Objectives." }, "Rival's Insignia of Adaptation"},
